  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation of Kigali HFC Phase-down Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation of Kigali HFC Phase-down Plan (Stage I) to help Brazil achieve the first obligations under the Kigali Amendment to the Montreal Protocol i.e. freeze of the HFC consumption at baseline level on 1 January 2024 and 10% reduction of the baseline HFC consumption by 1 January 2029.</narrative>
  </description>
